# FDB - Edit the disk format catalogue

```text
FDB [file.FDB]
```

## Work with entries

FDB opens a catalogue for inspection or editing. L lists entries, D
opens details, and P compares entries. S saves changes. Keep the
matching FDBVIEW.OVL beside FDB.COM for the detail and comparison views.

```text
FDB A0:DISK.FDB
```

## Convert formats

```text
FDB D0:WORK.FDB D0:WORK.FDF
FDB D0:WORK.FDF D0:NEW.FDB
```

FDB is the binary catalogue used by [CONFIG](CONFIG.HLP). FDF is its
editable text exchange format. Supply separate input and output
filenames for conversion.
